        "ai_rubric": {
          "Trigonometric Identities": "Combines fractions to $\\frac{2\\tan\\theta}{1-\\cos^2\\theta}$ (M1). Replaces denominator with $\\sin^2\\theta$ (M1). Substitutes $\\tan\\theta=\\frac{\\sin\\theta}{\\cos\\theta}$ (M1). Completes proof to $\\frac{2}{\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta}$ (A1)."
        },
